+The Popover positioner writes normal inline `position`, physical offsets and
+`maxHeight`, both in its returned props and directly while measuring. Dialog,
+drawer and narrow auto share that positioning hook with anchored popovers. Their
+CSS keeps three narrowly scoped important roles per presentation: fixed position,
+inset reset and maximum block size. In horizontal writing these block caps must
+beat the engine's physical inline `maxHeight`. The inset shorthand resets all
+physical edges before centering a dialog or attaching a drawer to the bottom.
+Dialog transform is normal CSS; anchored popover and wide auto retain the engine
+geometry. Do not remove those locks without replacing the position owner.
 
-| Selector condition | Important declaration | Intended geometry / host override impact |
-| --- | --- | --- |
-| `data-presentation="dialog"` | `position: fixed` | Uses viewport positioning instead of normal anchored inline positioning. Normal host position rules lose. |
-| dialog | `inset: 50% auto auto 50%` | Centers the origin; the normal `transform: translate(-50%,-50%)` completes centering. The important shorthand governs all four physical inset edges over normal inline offsets. |
-| dialog | `max-block-size: calc(100dvh - 2rem)` | Caps the block dimension with viewport margin instead of the base available-height cap. Normal host block-size caps lose. |
-| `data-presentation="drawer"` | `position: fixed` | Uses viewport positioning. Normal anchored/host position rules lose. |
-| drawer | `inset: auto 0 0` | Resets top and fixes left/right/bottom edges for bottom placement; normal physical offsets lose. |
-| drawer | `inline-size: 100%` | Requests full containing-block inline extent; overrides normal size variants/host width on the corresponding axis. |
-| drawer | `max-inline-size: 100%` | Replaces the normal root/size-variant inline cap; normal host caps lose. |
-| drawer | `max-block-size: 90dvh` | Caps the block dimension at 90% of dynamic viewport height; normal host block caps lose. |
-| `data-presentation="auto"`, viewport ≤40rem | `position: fixed` | Applies drawer positioning only under the media query; normal position rules lose there. |
-| narrow auto | `inset: auto 0 0` | Applies drawer bottom edges; normal physical offsets lose there. |
-| narrow auto | `inline-size: 100%` | Applies drawer inline extent; normal width/size variants lose there. |
-| narrow auto | `max-inline-size: 100%` | Applies drawer inline cap; normal host caps lose there. |
-| narrow auto | `max-block-size: 90dvh` | Applies drawer viewport block cap; normal host block caps lose there. |
